{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Title:</strong><br><i>Sheep vs Tigers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong><br>Turn-Based Strategy Puzzle Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual-Character Rivalry System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls a sheep on a grid-based map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sheep must outmaneuver AI-controlled tigers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both sides take turns, with each move triggering the opponent\u2019s response.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sheep\u2019s Special Abilities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can push boxes to alter the map layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to trap all tigers by strategically positioning boxes, rendering them immobile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiger\u2019s Behavior Patterns:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI tigers actively track the sheep\u2019s position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a tiger moves adjacent to the sheep, it will devour the sheep, resulting in failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tigers calculate the shortest path to reach the sheep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Flow:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players select a level from the stage selection menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the sheep to move and push boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each sheep move, the tigers take their turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully trapping all tigers leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the sheep is caught, players can instantly reset the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Target Audience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of strategic puzzle games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enthusiasts of block-pushing mechanics (e.g., <i>Sokoban</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy gamers.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/20eb2d1671fc781b1ffab2e6eabe385179b1aeda.jpg"},{"name":"10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/759e5a1bda73901412508f49f0da14940c1045bf.jpg"},{"name":"20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/1b2939067329b997846a4f106e51cca9f6a1c636.jpg"},{"name":"30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/47209014954665bb657167a93f029e2428f0e4f5.jpg"},{"name":"40","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/1350ece1da9a1a7e0538a7f768b468b2f60a3119.jpg"},{"name":"50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/92490343bc7ec7fe9f30dcac6393ac6b7c306f5e.jpg"},{"name":"55","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3613480/23dc3301bfaf0fa6310f087e1a0e7e5cf3f77475.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613480?t=1747809718","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613480?t=1747809718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613480/6eb9e82c8c1be53215ae397998e9998f2b598d4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747809718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613480/6eb9e82c8c1be53215ae397998e9998f2b598d4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747809718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descri